            <ArticleTitle>[Autonomic regulation of cardiac rhythm in elderly patients with bronchial asthma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>727-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Evaluation of independent and combined interrelations of bronchial obstruction and autonomic regulation of cardiac rhythm in elderly patients with bronchial asthma was carried out. Positive correlation of the extent of bronchial obstruction and decrease of absolute indices of cardiac rhythm variability was established.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
